 "message": "I can't file this TMS access request. This session is for Sam Okafor (E015), and under POL-ACC-01 only the employee themselves or their direct manager can file an access request for someone. Nobody else can file on another person's behalf. Samantha Lee (E016) reports to Priya Raman (E004), not to Sam, so the request has to come from Priya.\n\nPriya, if you're the one asking, please file the TMS request for E016 from your own account. Standard systems like TMS are approved by the employee's manager, so the approval will need to go through you as well and can't be marked approved in advance. Nothing has been filed or changed.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-ACC-01"
 ]
